@startuml
' Product diagram contract: UC-001..UC-010; BR-001..BR-012; AC-001..AC-022
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Human Player" as Player
actor "AI Party Members" as Party
actor "AI GM" as GM
actor "Game Engine" as Engine
actor "일반 세션 UI" as SessionUI

rectangle "Combat UI / Combat Mode" {
  usecase "UC-001\n전투 진입" as UC001
  usecase "UC-002\n플레이어 Turn 진행" as UC002
  usecase "UC-003\n정형 행동 실행" as UC003
  usecase "UC-004\n이동" as UC004
  usecase "UC-005\n자유 행동 선언" as UC005
  usecase "UC-006\nReaction 처리" as UC006
  usecase "UC-007\nAI 파티원 Turn" as UC007
  usecase "UC-008\n적/NPC Turn" as UC008
  usecase "UC-009\n전투 종료" as UC009
  usecase "UC-010\n전투 재개" as UC010
}

Player --> UC002
Player --> UC003
Player --> UC004
Player --> UC005
Player --> UC006
Player --> UC010

Party --> UC007
GM --> UC001
GM --> UC005
GM --> UC008
GM --> UC009
Engine --> UC001
Engine --> UC003
Engine --> UC004
Engine --> UC005
Engine --> UC006
Engine --> UC007
Engine --> UC008
Engine --> UC009
Engine --> UC010
SessionUI --> UC001
SessionUI --> UC009
SessionUI --> UC010

UC001 .> UC002 : Combat UI 표시 후
UC002 .> UC003 : 정형 행동
UC002 .> UC004 : 이동
UC002 .> UC005 : 비정형 선언
UC002 .> UC006 : Trigger 발생 시
UC007 .> UC006 : Trigger 발생 시
UC008 .> UC006 : Trigger 발생 시
UC009 .> UC002 : 모든 Turn 진행 중
UC010 .> UC002 : 저장된 Turn 복원

note bottom of UC003
실행 전 사거리·행동 조건 검증.
불가능하면 자원 소비 없이 차단.
end note

note bottom of UC005
입력 자체는 거부하지 않는다.
AI GM이 비용과 판정을 해석한다.
end note

note bottom of UC006
진행 중 Turn을 일시 중단하고
Reaction 해결 후 같은 지점에서 계속한다.
end note

@enduml
